{"version":2,"slug":"beginner-english-speaking-practice-real-life-role-play-a1","videoId":"7WGo4np9MxQ","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/7WGo4np9MxQ","lang":"en","title":"Beginner English Speaking Practice | Real-Life Role Play (A1)","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Let's shadow"},{"start":3,"text":"some simple English sentences."},{"start":9,"text":"To shadow is to repeat. I'm blue and"},{"start":16,"text":"you're red."},{"start":19,"text":"Hello."},{"start":22,"text":"How are you?"},{"start":28,"text":"I'm a little [sighs and gasps]"},{"start":31,"text":"tired."},{"start":33,"text":"I didn't sleep much last night."},{"start":42,"text":"The upstairs neighbor"},{"start":45,"text":"had loud music playing"},{"start":50,"text":"all night long."},{"start":59,"text":"Yes, he had company."},{"start":65,"text":"I know."},{"start":67,"text":"Who has a party on a Tuesday night?"},{"start":77,"text":"Seriously,"},{"start":78,"text":"the music was so loud."},{"start":83,"text":"It was so disrespectful."},{"start":90,"text":"No,"},{"start":92,"text":"I was too"},{"start":94,"text":"[sighs] tired to do anything about it."},{"start":104,"text":"I put a pillow"},{"start":107,"text":"over my head"},{"start":109,"text":"and I tried to fall asleep."},{"start":116,"text":"I know."},{"start":118,"text":"I really need my sleep."},{"start":122,"text":"I get"},{"start":125,"text":"crabby"},{"start":126,"text":"when I don't."},{"start":132,"text":"Yeah,"},{"start":134,"text":"I think I will."},{"start":137,"text":"I have to"},{"start":142,"text":"hopefully tonight will be"},{"start":146,"text":"quiet."},{"start":150,"text":"Anyways,"},{"start":152,"text":"how was your weekend?"},{"start":160,"text":"No way. You have loud neighbors, too."},{"start":166,"text":"[sighs]"},{"start":172,"text":"Nice."},{"start":174,"text":"Where did you go? You always ask me"},{"start":180,"text":"what the most important part of learning"},{"start":185,"text":"English is. For me, language is meant"},{"start":191,"text":"for communication."},{"start":194,"text":"So practicing real life situations"},{"start":200,"text":"is much more important"},{"start":204,"text":"than just learning from textbooks."},{"start":208,"text":"Let me tell you the story about what"},{"start":214,"text":"happened to me at the airport"},{"start":219,"text":"in Brazil. I had studied some Portuguese"},{"start":226,"text":"before"},{"start":228,"text":"and I felt confident that I could speak"},{"start":234,"text":"in Brazil and I felt confident with the"},{"start":240,"text":"vocabulary that I knew."},{"start":244,"text":"So, when I arrived at the airport and I"},{"start":251,"text":"realized"},{"start":253,"text":"my phone"},{"start":255,"text":"didn't have any"},{"start":259,"text":"battery,"},{"start":260,"text":"I couldn't order an Uber to my hostel,"},{"start":266,"text":"but it was okay."},{"start":270,"text":"I would just order a taxi. So, I went up"},{"start":276,"text":"to a taxi driver"},{"start":279,"text":"and"},{"start":280,"text":"I froze."},{"start":282,"text":"I knew each word individually,"},{"start":287,"text":"but forming a full sentence,"},{"start":292,"text":"I felt like a failure."},{"start":296,"text":"All those hours of studying to waste. I"},{"start":302,"text":"couldn't even ask for a taxi. I realized"},{"start":307,"text":"then just how important it is to learn a"},{"start":314,"text":"language for real conversations,"},{"start":319,"text":"not just textbook learning. If you're"},{"start":324,"text":"learning English"},{"start":326,"text":"and often feel stuck in real life"},{"start":332,"text":"conversations,"},{"start":333,"text":"I completely understand."},{"start":337,"text":"That's why I want to share an English"},{"start":342,"text":"learning app that focuses on real life"},{"start":348,"text":"situations"},{"start":350,"text":"so you won't freeze when you speak."},{"start":355,"text":"Spoky can help you practice these real"},{"start":359,"text":"life situations."},{"start":362,"text":"There's a learning road map based on"},{"start":365,"text":"real life situations"},{"start":368,"text":"like travel or daily conversations."},{"start":374,"text":"Pay attention to how I pronounce the"},{"start":376,"text":"word reservation."},{"start":379,"text":"Reservation."},{"start":383,"text":"Yes, I have a reservation."},{"start":391,"text":"I have a reservation."},{"start":394,"text":"I'd like to check in."},{"start":398,"text":"Yes, I need to practice these situations"},{"start":404,"text":"I find myself in when traveling. And"},{"start":409,"text":"Spoky has just that. Now, let's practice"},{"start":416,"text":"openended"},{"start":418,"text":"conversations"},{"start":419,"text":"with Spoky's AI free talk feature."},{"start":425,"text":"I like going out with my friends and"},{"start":427,"text":"doing crafts."},{"start":429,"text":"What kind of crafts do you like to make?"},{"start":431,"text":"I paint and make candles."},{"start":435,"text":"What colors do you like to use the most"},{"start":437,"text":"when you paint?"},{"start":439,"text":"I like both colors and aquarela."},{"start":445,"text":"See how it detects my mistakes and"},{"start":448,"text":"suggests natural expressions. I can also"},{"start":452,"text":"check the translation if I need to."},{"start":457,"text":"I think paint human bodies."},{"start":461,"text":"I think painting human bodies is the"},{"start":464,"text":"hardest."},{"start":466,"text":"Now I can practice speaking confidently"},{"start":471,"text":"every day. I'll leave the link to Spoky"},{"start":474,"text":"in the description and my bio. Check it"},{"start":478,"text":"out. Nice."},{"start":481,"text":"Where did you go?"},{"start":488,"text":"That sounds fun."},{"start":491,"text":"Was it crowded?"},{"start":499,"text":"Good."},{"start":501,"text":"I hate it when it's packed."},{"start":510,"text":"What did you guys do there?"},{"start":519,"text":"Sounds nice."},{"start":521,"text":"What did you bring along for the picnic?"},{"start":531,"text":"I love that."},{"start":533,"text":"Simple but perfect."},{"start":539,"text":"Was the weather nice?"},{"start":548,"text":"Lucky you."},{"start":550,"text":"It was freezing"},{"start":552,"text":"last night."},{"start":555,"text":"I opened the window to get fresh air and"},{"start":561,"text":"a break from the noise upstairs."},{"start":568,"text":"Not really, but at least I tried."},{"start":578,"text":"Exactly."},{"start":579,"text":"So, did you stay out late at the beach?"},{"start":591,"text":"Yeah, not too late. That's responsible."},{"start":601,"text":"Good thinking."},{"start":603,"text":"Mondays can be"},{"start":606,"text":"rough."},{"start":610,"text":"Did you take any pictures?"},{"start":616,"text":"Send them to me so I can see."},{"start":625,"text":"I'm so jealous."},{"start":627,"text":"I love sunsets."},{"start":635,"text":"[gasps] I know."},{"start":637,"text":"I should. I will."},{"start":644,"text":"Exactly."},{"start":646,"text":"No more loud neighbors for us. Honestly,"},{"start":652,"text":"weekends go by so fast."},{"start":660,"text":"It does. But at least you had a good"},{"start":665,"text":"time."},{"start":669,"text":"That's what matters."},{"start":672,"text":"So, what are you going to do next"},{"start":678,"text":"weekend?"},{"start":683,"text":"Oh, nice."},{"start":685,"text":"Are you going to stay long?"},{"start":693,"text":"That sounds lovely."},{"start":696,"text":"Are you going to drive there?"},{"start":703,"text":"Smart choice."},{"start":705,"text":"Are you going to do anything special"},{"start":707,"text":"with them?"},{"start":709,"text":"Remember, native speakers say gonna"},{"start":714,"text":"instead of going to gonna."},{"start":720,"text":"What are you going to have for dinner?"},{"start":729,"text":"Nice."},{"start":731,"text":"Sounds lovely."},{"start":733,"text":"Home-cooked."},{"start":740,"text":"Even better."},{"start":743,"text":"Are you going to relax, too?"},{"start":751,"text":"Good idea."},{"start":753,"text":"I need to relax too after the whole"},{"start":759,"text":"loud neighbor situation."},{"start":764,"text":"Are you going to see any friends while"},{"start":767,"text":"you're there?"},{"start":774,"text":"Nice. It's always good to catch up with"},{"start":778,"text":"friends."},{"start":781,"text":"How long has it been since you saw them"},{"start":785,"text":"last?"},{"start":796,"text":"It's hard to find time to see friends. I"},{"start":801,"text":"agree."},{"start":804,"text":"I love weekends like that."},{"start":808,"text":"simple"},{"start":810,"text":"and"},{"start":812,"text":"calm."},{"start":816,"text":"[sighs and gasps]"},{"start":817,"text":"I'm probably staying home next weekend."},{"start":824,"text":"[gasps]"},{"start":825,"text":"Um,"},{"start":827,"text":"I need to stay home and organize my life"},{"start":833,"text":"and"},{"start":835,"text":"be productive."},{"start":838,"text":"I've been slacking"},{"start":843,"text":"lately."},{"start":847,"text":"Exactly."},{"start":849,"text":"I procrastinate"},{"start":852,"text":"a lot."},{"start":854,"text":"I know. Not very exciting, but"},{"start":859,"text":"necessary."},{"start":867,"text":"I'm also going to meal prep for the"},{"start":870,"text":"week, which"},{"start":873,"text":"sounds boring,"},{"start":876,"text":"but to me it's very exciting."},{"start":884,"text":"I'm trying to be better this year."},{"start":891,"text":"Yeah,"},{"start":892,"text":"it'll be a productive weekend."},{"start":899,"text":"Fingers crossed."},{"start":902,"text":"This was shadowing practice for"},{"start":906,"text":"beginners."},{"start":908,"text":"Thank you for talking to me today. And"},{"start":912,"text":"if you like this video, you'll probably"},{"start":915,"text":"like these two. I made especially for"},{"start":919,"text":"you. See you next week."}]}